==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|þurfa}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*þurbaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈθʏrva/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|ʏrva}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-preterite|þarf|þurfti|þurft}}

# {{lb|is|with accusative or genitive}} to [[require]], to [[need]]
# {{lb|is|with accusative}} to [[have to]]
#: {{ux|is|Þú '''þarft''' ekki að hitta mig.|You don't '''need''' to see me.}}

